Z||000010||Devotshka||12-24-2001||02:12 PM||||Heres another pic of GSR's roadster... this is the picture that made me hang up the phone when i was considering using someone elses design....yuck... the angle on the rust/red colored one hides it a lot better, but i can't stand the lines from a rear view...  On an interesting side note, i called GSR a few months ago to ask about another part they sold, and their phone just rings off the hook now.... i guess i should be happy i didn't give them 4 grand  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fieroshop.com.au/gallery/images/convert8.jpg"> ||||reg||1
